{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454480/extras/1052c064720ccdafb77f013e8c5cb52f.poster.avif?t=1772553672\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454480/extras/1052c064720ccdafb77f013e8c5cb52f.webm?t=1772553672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454480/extras/1052c064720ccdafb77f013e8c5cb52f.mp4?t=1772553672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends and prove who is the best gnome! Throw, hit, dash, taunt, explode... Anything is valid to win and crown yourself the undisputed champion. Try to combine upgrades to maximize your build potential. Let chaos reign!<br><br><u><strong>FEATURES</strong></u><br><br><u><i>-\u00a0Customization</i></u><br>Choose from +5000 combinations to unleash your inner gnome. <br> <br><u><i>- Upgrades</i></u><br>Enhance all your abilities and change the game rules by choosing between +100 cards with different tiers and synergies. <br> <br><u><i>- Maps</i></u> <br>Play on +20 randomly selected maps with different themes, each featuring their own weapons<br><br><u><i>- Weapons</i></u><br>Anything can be a weapon if you have imagination and very few scruples. Use everything you see, including the heads of your rivals. You can even drive some of them! <br> <br><u><i>- Taunts</i></u><br>There\u2019s nothing better in life than mocking your enemies, whether before or after killing them. Choose the most offensive emote that suits your mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEMODES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>-\u00a0Classic</u></i><br>Free for all, no gnome is above the other, only one can stand, may the best gnome win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>-\u00a0Teams</u></i><br>Colaborative mode where you can group in teams to annihilate each other, in a balanced way (or not, as you wish).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>-\u00a0Prop Hunt</u></i><br>A gnome will search for the rest while they are hidden as objects. The most sneaky and clever gnome will win, unless is caught of course. <br> <br>30-minute matches that are fast, wild, but above all, very fun, generating both laughter and violence in equal measure. May the best gnome win!<strong><u>  </u></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Want a Medal?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3454480/12de657a3caec2d4747668d847b807ac62b1e570.jpg"},{"name":"Here, have a Tissue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3454480/5613d6ef4542a8a6723746ce169b7dca49b4000d.jpg"},{"name":"Masterclass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3454480/75971466bcf6248ac212589efb2ebf040152e8bc.jpg"},{"name":"What Happened?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3454480/706e63271fa8cc2e5ee862070883eee61a3a1daa.jpg"},{"name":"Very Impressive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3454480/cdf5b2c5377c0809a3191c2f368aafc40e6439a5.jpg"},{"name":"Turning the Tide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3454480/32ff2ecbd0b29c891f877451cb459045f2b39a6e.jpg"},{"name":"Have you tried opening your eyes?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3454480/f056a6e4b343f9280ef7568fd11189038afa8fd0.jpg"},{"name":"Kneel Before Me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3454480/f1745b49cb362d3238b9305dcb4b39681098496e.jpg"},{"name":"Luckless Gnome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3454480/0550d